  "html": "<h1 id=\"patternfly-java\" class=\"pf-v6-c-title pf-m-4xl\">PatternFly Java</h1>\n<p>Build enterprise web applications in pure Java with <a href=\"https://www.patternfly.org/\">PatternFly</a> components — no JavaScript required.</p>\n<p>PatternFly Java is a 💯 Java implementation of PatternFly that integrates with and builds upon Elemento's <a href=\"https://hal-console.gitbook.io/elemento/builder-api\">builder API</a>. It works with both GWT and J2CL, giving you a type-safe, fluent API to create complex web applications entirely in Java.</p>\n<h2 id=\"a-taste-of-the-api\" class=\"pf-v6-c-title pf-m-2xl\">A Taste of the API</h2>\n<p>The following code snippet shows how PatternFly Java lets you build a complete page layout with just a few lines of Java:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">body</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addSkipToContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">skipToContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"main-id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addMasthead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">masthead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addMain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mastheadMain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addToggle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mastheadToggle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addBrand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mastheadBrand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addLogo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mastheadLogo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(<